	(text "BLUE = 5 V power present; PURPLE = power + termination enabled.\nGreen unused. PC15 HIGH disables termination and red.\nReset Hi-Z defaults to PURPLE once 10 V VCC is present.\nPC15: low-speed push-pull; keep LSE disabled. No status blinking.\nQ301 isolates LED current from the CAN termination gate drive.\nWith USB-only power / no 10 V rail: blue only; termination unavailable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 153.67 0)
